    Add search endpoint to trigger single event index update (#6653)
    
    This PR is the equivalent to
    https://github.com/opencast/opencast/pull/6575 but for the search index.
    It adds an endpoint to trigger the index update for a single event. This
    can be useful for fixing broken events. I also restricted this to
    admins, same as the inititial PR.
    
    
